<title>ESTONIA: CAR REGISTRATIONS DOWN IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>CAR REGISTRATIONS DOWN IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The car registration centre said on Friday that there were 441 new cars registered in June, down from 503 in May.  </p>
<p>The most popular car was Toyota with 79 cars registered. It was followed by 67 Nissans, 52 Mazdas and 55 Opels.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
